{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ang air-core modelo ay gumagamit ng isang-layer approximation Wheeler ng at ay isang rough gabay kapag linya diameter ay mas mababa sa ZXQPH0000QXZ × winding haba. Ito omits wire kapal, spacing, malapit na metal, dalas, parasitiko kapasitansya at mga kondisyon ng pagsukat. Para sa isang toroid, ipasok ang AL kadahilanan mula sa kanyang eksaktong core datasheet; AL at permeability ay maaaring baguhin sa dalas, temperatura, DC bias, gap at pagmamanupaktura tolerance. Kumpirmahin ang anumang tunay na disenyo sa core tagagawa at pagsukat.","record_id":"3caea4b3ff3fdc1eae8116a5c0fe481165e174bbcac98f431bb2676fde458efa","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.271430217499983,"source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ang air-core modelo ay gumagamit ng isang-layer approximation Wheeler ng at ay isang rough gabay kapag linya diameter ay mas mababa sa 3 × winding haba. Ito omits wire kapal, spacing, malapit na metal, dalas, parasitiko kapasitansya at mga kondisyon ng pagsukat. Para sa isang toroid, ipasok ang AL kadahilanan mula sa kanyang eksaktong core datasheet; AL at permeability ay maaaring baguhin sa dalas, temperatura, DC bias, gap at pagmamanupaktura tolerance. Kumpirmahin ang anumang tunay na disenyo sa core tagagawa at pagsukat.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
